        "7.8.8 转发MODBUS服务配置",
        "7.8.8.3 Modbus TCP快调模式"
      ],
      "section_title": "7.8.8.3 Modbus TCP快调模式",
      "block_type": "list",
      "text": "•\n使用Modbus TCP 快调时，需在后台与数采Logger4000 的ETH3 或ETH4 快调口之间\n架设一台交换机，并通过网线将两者进行连接。网线类型选择通用性标准网线即可，如\nCAT5E 类/长度75cm 网线。",
      "table_cells": null,
      "bbox": [
        88.192,
        375.832,
        446.941,
        413.785
      ],
      "extraction_method": "native_text",
      "needs_review": false,
      "review_notes": []
    },
    {
      "block_id": "BLK-16D41FADCB0DFC60",
      "document_id": "DOC-C034D56CBBB3",
      "source_sha256": "5a9b4f97ff44c0e39b26b5dff963b60b40eede9431301fd5c6324ac9da5f1d99",
      "parser_version": "1.5.0",
      "pdf_page": 76,
      "printed_page_label": "66",
      "block_order": 18,
      "section_id": "SEC-81C0A7BD9B76451C",
      "section_path": [
        "7 Web界面",
        "7.8 系统",
        "7.8.8 转发MODBUS服务配置",
        "7.8.8.3 Modbus TCP快调模式"
      ],
      "section_title": "7.8.8.3 Modbus TCP快调模式",
      "block_type": "list",
      "text": "•\n只需配置快调端口ETH3 或ETH4 其中一个网口的IP 地址即可，尽可能与后台IP 设置成\n同一网段。",
      "table_cells": null,
      "bbox": [
        88.192,
        417.832,
        453.385,
        442.285
      ],
      "extraction_method": "native_text",
      "needs_review": false,
      "review_notes": []
    },
    {
      "block_id": "BLK-F28FB76EE6ADD06B",
      "document_id": "DOC-C034D56CBBB3",
      "source_sha256": "5a9b4f97ff44c0e39b26b5dff963b60b40eede9431301fd5c6324ac9da5f1d99",
      "parser_version": "1.5.0",
      "pdf_page": 76,
      "printed_page_label": "66",
      "block_order": 19,
      "section_id": "SEC-81C0A7BD9B76451C",
      "section_path": [
        "7 Web界面",
        "7.8 系统",
        "7.8.8 转发MODBUS服务配置",
        "7.8.8.3 Modbus TCP快调模式"
      ],
      "section_title": "7.8.8.3 Modbus TCP快调模式",
      "block_type": "list",
      "text": "•\nLogger4000 的固件版本为P019 及以上支持Modbus TCP 快调。见7.8.16 查看\n固件版本。",
      "table_cells": null,
      "bbox": [
        115.193,
        457.332,
        444.971,
        481.785
      ],
      "extraction_method": "native_text",
      "needs_review": false,
      "review_notes": []
    },
    {
      "block_id": "BLK-BAAA89CF6564A4CC",
      "document_id": "DOC-C034D56CBBB3",
      "source_sha256": "5a9b4f97ff44c0e39b26b5dff963b60b40eede9431301fd5c6324ac9da5f1d99",
