      "section_path": [
        "7 Web界面",
        "7.8 系统",
        "7.8.8 转发MODBUS服务配置",
        "7.8.8.3 Modbus TCP快调模式"
      ],
      "section_title": "7.8.8.3 Modbus TCP快调模式",
      "block_type": "list",
      "text": "•\nModbus TCP 快调与GOOSE 转发协议不可同时开启。",
      "table_cells": null,
      "bbox": [
        115.193,
        485.832,
