      "section_title": "7.8.8.3 Modbus TCP快调模式",
      "block_type": "list",
      "text": "•\nModbus TCP 快调仅支持开环控制。",
      "table_cells": null,
      "bbox": [
        115.193,
        500.832,
        274.133,
