      "block_order": 22,
      "section_id": "SEC-81C0A7BD9B76451C",
      "section_path": [
        "7 Web界面",
        "7.8 系统",
        "7.8.8 转发MODBUS服务配置",
        "7.8.8.3 Modbus TCP快调模式"
      ],
      "section_title": "7.8.8.3 Modbus TCP快调模式",
      "block_type": "paragraph",
      "text": "开启Modbus TCP 快调功能后，必须确保后台下发的调度指令的间隔时间满足以下\n要求，否则逆变器可能无法完全响应目标值。",
      "table_cells": null,
      "bbox": [
        115.193,
        533.982,
        442.208,
        555.735
      ],
      "extraction_method": "native_text",
      "needs_review": false,
      "review_notes": []
    },
    {
      "block_id": "BLK-AD0FBB0DC18CBDD4",
      "document_id": "DOC-C034D56CBBB3",
      "source_sha256": "5a9b4f97ff44c0e39b26b5dff963b60b40eede9431301fd5c6324ac9da5f1d99",
      "parser_version": "1.5.0",
      "pdf_page": 76,
      "printed_page_label": "66",
      "block_order": 23,
      "section_id": "SEC-81C0A7BD9B76451C",
      "section_path": [
        "7 Web界面",
        "7.8 系统",
        "7.8.8 转发MODBUS服务配置",
        "7.8.8.3 Modbus TCP快调模式"
      ],
      "section_title": "7.8.8.3 Modbus TCP快调模式",
      "block_type": "list",
      "text": "•\n有功功率调节：调度间隔需为60 毫秒或以上。",
      "table_cells": null,
      "bbox": [
        115.193,
        558.432,
        314.876,
        569.385
      ],
      "extraction_method": "native_text",
